NATO representatives and industry experts met in Helsinki to address the security of undersea telecommunications cables in the Baltic Sea 🌊. Discussions centered on assessing vulnerabilities and bolstering infrastructure resilience against potential sabotage. Enhanced monitoring and joint exercises were agreed upon to protect these vital communication lines 🛡️. The summit highlighted increasing regional concerns.
#BalticSea #Cybersecurity
