EU foreign ministers are gathered in Luxembourg for an urgent meeting to discuss Mediterranean migration management 🇪🇺. The focus is on a potential agreement with North African nations to strengthen border security and reduce irregular migration. This accord would aim to streamline returns and improve efforts against human trafficking. Some ministers are anticipated to raise concerns about implementation and human rights protections 🙏.
#MigrationEU #Luxembourg
